{"3307700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The First Spine - Arena", "steam_appid": 3307700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The First Spine Arena is an exhilarating online competitive board-and-card game where two wizards clash in a tactical duel to reach the opponent's side. Every match plays on a dynamic grid, and you'll summon creatures, artifacts, and cast spells to tip the battlefield in your favor. Thanks to level-based card generation and a robust matchmaking system, every duel feels fair, fresh, and aggressively competitive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/8236323cc1e34c5f9b9510bab34c7acb.avif?t=1778054587\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/7d1fda224783f73ef1b980015206d9a9.poster.avif?t=1778054587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/7d1fda224783f73ef1b980015206d9a9.webm?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/7d1fda224783f73ef1b980015206d9a9.mp4?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dynamic 7×7 battlefield for a strategic experience where every move counts. In The First Spine Arena, cards are entities on the board rather than just resources. Each one occupies space, moves, and attacks based on its unique attributes, creating a layered tactical challenge. The terrain itself becomes part of your strategy: lava scorches careless units, water slows movement, and ditches offer cover or danger depending on your positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the map, outmaneuver your rival, and claim control of key zones to dominate the arena.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/33b3e72139e533a7f4b060809d6d37a3.avif?t=1778054587\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/2e27fd826af537de3767a2edda1f120c.poster.avif?t=1778054587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/2e27fd826af537de3767a2edda1f120c.webm?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/2e27fd826af537de3767a2edda1f120c.mp4?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match in The First Spine Arena rewards you with new cards, expanding your tactical arsenal and unlocking fresh possibilities. As your collection grows, so does your ability to experiment with powerful archetypes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive bruisers that storm the board with brute force</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive guardians that hold the line and stall enemy advances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trickster familiars that warp across the grid and disrupt enemy plans</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 90 unique blueprints, you can craft hybrid decks tailored to your playstyle. Mix artifact buffs with creature swarms, or weave devastating spell combos into your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whether you prefer overwhelming pressure or clever misdirection, your deck is your identity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/6723ba2cfc2d688b3e17dd145efb90f2.avif?t=1778054587\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/a2e06634f0c1d9e73203a99ad1b73134.poster.avif?t=1778054587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/a2e06634f0c1d9e73203a99ad1b73134.webm?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/a2e06634f0c1d9e73203a99ad1b73134.mp4?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each match, you'll loot unique cards scaled precisely to your current level, ensuring every addition to your deck feels earned and impactful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the spoils don't stop there:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather Ancient Shards, and use them to forge creatures and artifacts. These creations can turn the tide of battle, granting your deck new tactical depth and devastating abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the secrets of Fated Knowledge, a collection of blueprints that reveal powerful spells. With each deciphering, your decks evolve, becoming sharper, stronger, and more attuned to your personal playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress is etched into every card you craft.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/62579cf78a0485fd025831f6e941bb67.avif?t=1778054587\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/2e4b7cd13258a97f6cd308ff4afb7b9d.poster.avif?t=1778054587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/2e4b7cd13258a97f6cd308ff4afb7b9d.webm?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/2e4b7cd13258a97f6cd308ff4afb7b9d.mp4?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our level-based matchmaking system pairs you with opponents of equal skill, making each match a true test of strategy, not brute force. So, whether you're a fledgling spellcaster or a seasoned master of the board, each fight is fair for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match pushes you closer to the top and unlocks exclusive cosmetic rewards, rare cards, and bragging rights across the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, qtay sharp: seasonal events shake up the battlefield with new rules, limited-time blueprints, and rotating leaderboards. Adapt your deck, master the meta, and seize your moment before the season resets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power is earned, not given. Are you ready to rise?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/3ca5ff34e1807e1f21bce5131f002eec.avif?t=1778054587\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balanced card generation tied to player level for fair, challenging battles.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep tactical gameplay mixing board control &amp; deck building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless build variety: 60+ blueprints, infinite deck combinations.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robust crafting: forge artifacts &amp; creatures, decipher lost spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular seasons, story quests, and limited-time events to keep the meta evolving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-platform matchmaking to connect with rivals worldwide.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The First Spine Arena is an exhilarating online competitive board-and-card game where two wizards clash in a tactical duel to reach the opponent's side. Every match plays on a dynamic grid, and you'll summon creatures, artifacts, and cast spells to tip the battlefield in your favor. Thanks to level-based card generation and a robust matchmaking system, every duel feels fair, fresh, and aggressively competitive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/8236323cc1e34c5f9b9510bab34c7acb.avif?t=1778054587\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/7d1fda224783f73ef1b980015206d9a9.poster.avif?t=1778054587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/7d1fda224783f73ef1b980015206d9a9.webm?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/7d1fda224783f73ef1b980015206d9a9.mp4?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dynamic 7×7 battlefield for a strategic experience where every move counts. In The First Spine Arena, cards are entities on the board rather than just resources. Each one occupies space, moves, and attacks based on its unique attributes, creating a layered tactical challenge. The terrain itself becomes part of your strategy: lava scorches careless units, water slows movement, and ditches offer cover or danger depending on your positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the map, outmaneuver your rival, and claim control of key zones to dominate the arena.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/33b3e72139e533a7f4b060809d6d37a3.avif?t=1778054587\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/2e27fd826af537de3767a2edda1f120c.poster.avif?t=1778054587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/2e27fd826af537de3767a2edda1f120c.webm?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/2e27fd826af537de3767a2edda1f120c.mp4?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match in The First Spine Arena rewards you with new cards, expanding your tactical arsenal and unlocking fresh possibilities. As your collection grows, so does your ability to experiment with powerful archetypes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive bruisers that storm the board with brute force</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive guardians that hold the line and stall enemy advances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trickster familiars that warp across the grid and disrupt enemy plans</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 90 unique blueprints, you can craft hybrid decks tailored to your playstyle. Mix artifact buffs with creature swarms, or weave devastating spell combos into your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whether you prefer overwhelming pressure or clever misdirection, your deck is your identity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/6723ba2cfc2d688b3e17dd145efb90f2.avif?t=1778054587\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/a2e06634f0c1d9e73203a99ad1b73134.poster.avif?t=1778054587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/a2e06634f0c1d9e73203a99ad1b73134.webm?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/a2e06634f0c1d9e73203a99ad1b73134.mp4?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each match, you'll loot unique cards scaled precisely to your current level, ensuring every addition to your deck feels earned and impactful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the spoils don't stop there:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather Ancient Shards, and use them to forge creatures and artifacts. These creations can turn the tide of battle, granting your deck new tactical depth and devastating abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the secrets of Fated Knowledge, a collection of blueprints that reveal powerful spells. With each deciphering, your decks evolve, becoming sharper, stronger, and more attuned to your personal playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress is etched into every card you craft.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/62579cf78a0485fd025831f6e941bb67.avif?t=1778054587\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/2e4b7cd13258a97f6cd308ff4afb7b9d.poster.avif?t=1778054587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/2e4b7cd13258a97f6cd308ff4afb7b9d.webm?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/2e4b7cd13258a97f6cd308ff4afb7b9d.mp4?t=1778054587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our level-based matchmaking system pairs you with opponents of equal skill, making each match a true test of strategy, not brute force. So, whether you're a fledgling spellcaster or a seasoned master of the board, each fight is fair for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match pushes you closer to the top and unlocks exclusive cosmetic rewards, rare cards, and bragging rights across the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, qtay sharp: seasonal events shake up the battlefield with new rules, limited-time blueprints, and rotating leaderboards. Adapt your deck, master the meta, and seize your moment before the season resets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power is earned, not given. Are you ready to rise?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/extras/3ca5ff34e1807e1f21bce5131f002eec.avif?t=1778054587\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balanced card generation tied to player level for fair, challenging battles.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep tactical gameplay mixing board control &amp; deck building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless build variety: 60+ blueprints, infinite deck combinations.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robust crafting: forge artifacts &amp; creatures, decipher lost spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular seasons, story quests, and limited-time events to keep the meta evolving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-platform matchmaking to connect with rivals worldwide.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The First Spine Arena is an exhilarating online competitive board and card game. In this game, players place their unique cards on a board with the goal of reaching their opponent's side. Each card is generated according to the player's level, ensuring a balanced and challenging experience for all.", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/9a0cc27c5be4fcbb9201ee0df96ba44576ca24a3/header.jpg?t=1778054587", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/ec4680a27734a0743e86bf6d25906e10a61a6d38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778054587", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307700/ec4680a27734a0743e86bf6d25906e10a61a6d38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778054587", "website": "https://www.thefirstspine.fr/arena", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64